How to test this ?

Start the server using the `cargo run` command. To verify it, you can use the standard `aws-cli` utility (or the MinIO client) by redirecting requests to the local port using the `--endpoint-url` flag

01.Creating a bucket:

  aws --endpoint-url http://localhost:8014 s3 mb s3://mybucket 

02.Uploading test file:

  echo "hello from rust S3 !" > test.txt
  aws --endpoint-url http://localhost:8014 s3 cp test.txt s3://mybucket/test.txt

03.Downloading the file back:

  aws --endpoint-url http://localhost:8014 s3 cp s3://mybucket/test.txt downloaded.txt
  cat downloaded.txt

